{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772550/extras/47c64cd584da225bf1f518b8bb8c4c3c.avif?t=1770384418\" width=567 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CIVITA is a First-Person Shooter game that offers  multiplayer PVP action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use a variety of weapons and equipment to cooperate with their teammates or face off against enemies alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the standout features of this game is the rope action, which allows players to move quickly between buildings or strategically ambush enemies from high vantage points, providing a unique combat experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, with its long TTK, each battle is prolonged and more strategic, giving players more opportunities to turn the tide of combat.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2772550?t=1770384418","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772550/470e59f00a2b1f3ff60ea583d7870db128ef5112/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770384418","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772550/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770384418","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772550/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770384418","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3589500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772550/extras/47c64cd584da225bf1f518b8bb8c4c3c.avif?t=1770384418\" width=567 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"b